## Verification Plan

### Build Verification
```bash
cmake -B build
cmake --build build
.\build\engine_editor.exe
```

### Visual Verification
- Launch the editor and visually compare against the reference image
- Check every panel for correct proportions, spacing, and styling
- Verify all existing functionality still works (menu items, toolbar buttons, tree selection, property editing, undo/redo, log output)

### Functional Regression Tests
- Verify Ctrl+Z/Y undo/redo still works
- Verify content browser search and folder navigation
- Verify outliner search and node selection
- Verify details panel transform editing with command stack
- Verify render control strip toggle and settings
- Verify viewport overlay stats and gizmos
- Verify status bar real-time stats display
- Verify window drag, minimize, maximize, close

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a visual-fidelity focused rewrite. All changes are to styling, layout, spacing, text labels, and visual presentation. **No functional logic is being removed or altered.** The core architecture (EditorState, CommandStack, SceneGraph, AssetRegistry, ViewportRenderer, Logger) remains completely untouched.
